      "rationale": "The full thesis is primarily a metatheoretical and philosophy-of-social-science inquiry into explanation in theories of Latin American popular habitat. Its research questions and objectives explicitly analyze logical organization and presuppositional content, especially ontology and epistemology; its theoretical construction is organized around Bungean systemism, Bhaskar's critical realism, Archer's structure-agency theory and mechanistic social explanation. The later urban empirical case validates the previously constructed metatheoretical/explanatory scheme rather than displacing that philosophical-conceptual research object. Under the strict humanities-only target, this work-specific disciplinary framing supports INCLUDE even though the program remains interdisciplinary REVIEW.",
